  "geometry_notes": [
   "Stems centred 5'-0\" apart, 15 in wide at the flange underside (1'-3\"), battered 0.375 in per 12 in per face down to the tabulated base width C (15 - 2*0.375*(B-flange)/12 = C holds for every row); R=4 in fillets at all four stem-flange junctions; 3/4 in chamfers at the stem soffit corners.",
   "NEXT D: 8 in deck flange of width A. The flange-edge shear key is drawn but not dimensioned; scaled from a 600 dpi render of C-3 as a 1 in deep recess: 1 in land, 1 in taper, 4 in flat, 1 in taper, 1 in land (5 in2 per side). Not fitted; area residuals -0.02 % to -0.10 %.",
   "NEXT F: 4 in form flange; 1/4 in draft on the edge (A is the top width) and an undimensioned rounded bottom edge corner, scaled as R=2 in. Area residuals +0.01 to +0.02 %.",
   "A = min/max tabulated widths (96/120 in for D; 95.5/143.5 in for F). Fillets polygonised with 32 chords."
  ],
